```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner activation issue --help
Issue a runner activation

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner activation issue [OPTIONS] --activation-file <PATH|-> <ORGANIZATION> <RUNNER>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <RUNNER>        Runner ID or exact name

Options:
      --activation-file <PATH|->       Write the issued activation to a protected artifact file, or only the artifact to stdout
      --json                           Print the runner result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

Activation:
  Each activation can be used only once.

```
